      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3730" name="W3730. Ethics Risk Assessment &amp; Heat-Mapping" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk cycle (links to VS-21.2); case trend; change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: Enterprise ethics-risk map
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Risk
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Audit (links to VS-21), ABC (links to VS-86), LP (links to VS-23), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), Treasury (links to VS-18), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Cross-Entity (links to VS-72)
Source: workflow W3730 — Ethics Risk Assessment &amp; Heat-Mapping</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3730_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3730_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3730_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3730_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3730_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3730_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3730_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3730_Start3" name="Annual risk cycle (links to VS-21.2); case trend; change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3730_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3730_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Risk conduct the ethics-risk assessment: identify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Risk conduct the ethics-risk assessment: identify inherent ethics/compliance risks across functions (cash-handling theft, procurement/AP bribery, B2G bid corruption, vendor kickbacks, harassment/discrimination, safety shortcuts, data misuse, conflicts), assess likelihood/impact, and produce the heat-map by function/location/entity
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Risk / Function owners
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3730_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3730_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3730_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess control coverage for each risk…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess control coverage for each risk (preventive/detective), identify gaps, and prioritize mitigation; integrate to enterprise risk management (links to VS-21.2) and the risk register
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Risk / Internal Controls
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3730_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3730_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3730_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer refresh the risk map from case trends (W3729)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer refresh the risk map from case trends (W3729), regulatory change (links to VS-22.3), and business change (new channels, entities, vendors); report residual ethics-risk to the risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36) and drive mitigation
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Risk
Accountable (A): Ethics Committee / Risk Committee
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3730_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3730_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3730_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3730_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3730_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-588 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Analytics, Culture &amp; Program Assurance (PA-119.3).) | - operational: integration to VS-21; operational: case-driven refresh
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Risk</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3730_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3730_Annotation8" targetRef="W3730_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3730_Flow10" sourceRef="W3730_Start3" targetRef="W3730_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3730_Flow11" sourceRef="W3730_Task4" targetRef="W3730_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3730_Flow12" sourceRef="W3730_Task5" targetRef="W3730_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3730_Flow13" sourceRef="W3730_Task6" targetRef="W3730_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3730_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3730_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3730">
