    <bpmn:process id="W_W3733" name="W3733. Third-Party &amp; Supply-Chain Integrity Due Diligence" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor onboarding (links to VS-03); periodic review; integrity concern
Frequency: Per vendor + periodic
Volume: ~800–1,000 vendors; high-risk third-party subset
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Vendor Management
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Vendor Mgmt (links to VS-03), Procurement (links to VS-34), ABC (links to VS-86.1), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Finance (links to VS-17), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W3733 — Third-Party &amp; Supply-Chain Integrity Due Diligence</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3733_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3733_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3733_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
