        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3733_Start3" name="Vendor onboarding (links to VS-03); periodic review; integrity concern">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3733_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3733_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Vendor Mgmt conduct third-party integrity due…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Vendor Mgmt conduct third-party integrity due diligence at onboarding (links to VS-03.1/W353 ethical sourcing): ownership/beneficial-ownership, sanctions/PEP screening (links to VS-86.1), adverse-media, anti-corruption controls, and integrity risk-rating; escalate high-risk third parties
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Vendor Mgmt / ABC
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3733_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3733_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3733_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage high-risk third parties: enhanced due…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer manage high-risk third parties: enhanced due diligence, integrity contractual clauses (anti-bribery, audit rights, termination), ongoing monitoring, and periodic re-screening; coordinate with ABC KYC (links to VS-86.1)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / ABC / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3733_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3733_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3733_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer investigate third-party integrity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer investigate third-party integrity concerns/allegations (kickbacks, bid-rigging, fake invoicing, modern-slavery) with Vendor Mgmt/Legal, manage remediation/delisting (links to VS-67/W2466), and report third-party integrity risk to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and risk (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Vendor Mgmt / Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: On concern</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3733_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3733_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3733_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3733_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
