    <bpmn:process id="W_W3734" name="W3734. Ethics Program Audit &amp; Assurance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual audit cycle; regulator; program review
Frequency: Annual + on event
Volume: Program audit
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Internal Audit
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Internal Audit (links to VS-21.3), External Audit (where required), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Records (links to VS-88), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W3734 — Ethics Program Audit &amp; Assurance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3734_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3734_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3734_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3734_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3734_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
