      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3734_Start3" name="Annual audit cycle; regulator; program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3734_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3734_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit conduct the annual ethics-program audit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit conduct the annual ethics-program audit: intake/triage (W3715/W3717), investigation quality/timeliness (W3721–W3723), action completion (W3724), retaliation monitoring (W3725), confidentiality/protection (W3716), policy/training (W3714/W3718), and analytics (W3729); internal and (where required) external
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3734_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3734_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3734_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess program effectiveness against a maturity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess program effectiveness against a maturity model (ISO 37001/37301-aligned), test controls from the internal-controls matrix, and identify assurance gaps; manage findings to closure
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit / Internal Controls
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3734_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3734_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3734_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit report program-assurance posture and findings…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Audit report program-assurance posture and findings to the Ethics Committee (W3719) and board audit committee (links to VS-36); support external audit and regulatory examination
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3734_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3734_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3734_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3734_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
