    <bpmn:process id="W_W3735" name="W3735. Multi-Entity Ethics Coordination &amp; Governance Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multi-entity case; consolidated governance reporting
Frequency: Ongoing + quarterly
Volume: 5 legal entities
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Cross-Entity
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Cross-Entity Shared Services (links to VS-72), entity HR/Legal, Audit (links to VS-21), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36), Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3735 — Multi-Entity Ethics Coordination &amp; Governance Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3735_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3735_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3735_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3735_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
