      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3735_Start3" name="Multi-entity case; consolidated governance reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3735_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3735_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate the ethics program across the 5 legal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer coordinate the ethics program across the 5 legal entities (Holdings, Depot, Logistics, Digital Commerce, Property Management): apply a consistent Code/policy/channel while respecting entity-level legal/HR differences; manage cross-entity cases (misconduct spanning entities)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Cross-Entity / Entity HR-Legal
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3735_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3735_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3735_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer consolidate entity-level ethics data into group…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer consolidate entity-level ethics data into group program reporting: aggregate report volume/substantiation/action across entities for group governance (links to VS-36) and group audit (links to VS-21)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Cross-Entity / BI
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3735_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3735_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3735_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Records manage entity-level and group case…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer/Records manage entity-level and group case records/retention (links to VS-88) and legal-hold (links to VS-88.2), and support group/external audit and consolidated governance reporting to the board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Records / Cross-Entity
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3735_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3735_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3735_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3735_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
