    <bpmn:process id="W_W3736" name="W3736. Ethics Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual program review; maturity assessment
Frequency: Annual + quarterly
Volume: Program maturity
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Participants: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer, Audit (links to VS-21), Risk (links to VS-21.2), BI (links to VS-28.1), Ethics Committee (links to W3719), Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36), HR (links to VS-103)
Source: workflow W3736 — Ethics Program Maturity &amp; Continuous Improvement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3736_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3736_Lane1" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3736_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3736_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3736_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3736_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3736_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3736_Start3" name="Annual program review; maturity assessment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3736_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3736_Task4" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess program maturity against a maturity model…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer assess program maturity against a maturity model (reactive → compliant → proactive → integrated, ISO 37001/37301-aligned), identify gaps, and set the maturity roadmap
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer / Audit
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3736_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3736_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3736_Task5" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer drive continuous improvement: expand channel reach…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer drive continuous improvement: expand channel reach (front-line/vendor), advance analytics (W3729), strengthen culture (W3731), mature controls from detective to preventive, and integrate deeper with ABC/audit/risk/HR
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3736_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3736_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3736_Task6" name="Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer report program maturity, integrity outcomes, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer report program maturity, integrity outcomes, and residual ethics-risk to the Ethics Committee (W3719), the board audit/risk committee (links to VS-21.2/VS-36), and the board; sustain independence, authority, and resourcing
Responsible (R): Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3736_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3736_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3736_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3736_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3736_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-588 (ensure controlled execution — Ethics Analytics, Culture &amp; Program Assurance (PA-119.3).) | - operational: maturity roadmap; operational: board oversight
Owner: Ethics &amp; Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
